1865
01:21:44.820 --> 01:21:52.380
Archibald Query invented a cream he called Marshmallow Cream in Somerville, Massachusetts in 1917.

1866
01:21:53.140 --> 01:22:04.680
And during World War I, Emma Curtis published a recipe for what she called the Liberty Sandwich, which was peanut butter and her snowflake marshmallow cream on oat or barley bread.

1867
01:22:04.680 --> 01:22:12.240
